<section>
  <h2>G. From forecast to decision: Hold / Sell / Store <span class="tag built">BUILT + TESTED</span></h2>
  <p>The rule advises holding only when the median forecast, after weekly losses, beats today's price by at least 5%, and the pessimistic (P10) outcome after losses is no worse than 10% below today's price. Otherwise: sell now. Holding never exceeds the crop's safe shelf life.</p>
  ${table_rules}
  <h3>Backtest of the rule on the selected series (12 months, real outcomes)</h3>
  ${table_decision}
  <p>${decision_reading}</p>
  <div class="note">The parameters above are illustrative placeholders, not agronomic advice. In the project they will be set with AAU post-harvest specialists and AMIU for each crop, storage type and season, and the same backtest will be rerun before any advisory is published.</div>
</section>

